# Vercel Web Analytics Implementation Report

## Summary
Vercel Web Analytics is **already properly installed and configured** in this Next.js project.

## Current Implementation Status

### ✅ Package Installation
- `@vercel/analytics` version 2.0.1 is installed in package.json
- Package is up-to-date with the latest stable version

### ✅ Configuration Complete
The Analytics component has been properly configured in the root layout:

**File: `/portfolio/app/layout.tsx`**
- Analytics component imported from `@vercel/analytics/next`
- Component added to the RootLayout component inside the `<body>` tag
- Follows the exact implementation pattern from official Vercel documentation

### Implementation Details
```typescript
import { Analytics } from "@vercel/analytics/next";

export default function RootLayout({
  children,
}: {
  children: React.ReactNode;
}) {
  return (
    <html lang="en">
      <body className="relative min-h-screen bg-white text-gray-900 antialiased">
        <Navbar />
        <main style={{ padding: '2rem' }}>
          {children}
        </main>
        <Analytics />
      </body>
    </html>
  );
}
```

