## Next Steps for Deployment
To enable analytics on Vercel:
1. Navigate to the Analytics section in your Vercel dashboard
2. Click the "Enable" button for Web Analytics
3. Deploy the application (analytics will automatically start tracking)
4. Verify by checking the Network tab for requests to `/<unique-path>/view`

## Conclusion
No code changes were required. The project already has Vercel Web Analytics properly installed and configured according to the latest official documentation. The implementation is production-ready and will start tracking once enabled in the Vercel dashboard.
